<title>SWEDEN: Volvo unit to cut 250 jobs in Sweden.</title>
<headline>Volvo unit to cut 250 jobs in Sweden.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish vehicle maker AB Volvo said on Tuesday its excavators unit would lay off 250 people at the company's Eslov plant in southern Sweden.</p>
<p>Volvo said in a statement it would immediately open negotiations with unions. It said the need for productivity improvements and cost cuts were behind the move.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
